' v1.2's autosave before a journey (`AutosaveManager`, `MapScene.TravelToLocation`;
' `preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30 savefile autosave-1.sav`, so that
' `load` takes the first slot). Setting out for Refinery writes
' `autosave-1` (day 1), the way back `autosave-2` (day 3). `load` takes up
' `autosave-1`: the next journey goes without one (`OnGameLoaded`), the one
' after writes over the slot saved longest ago, `autosave-1`. On the Saves
' page both show in brackets and cannot be deleted (`autosaves`).
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 3
press up
press right              ' Refinery
press q                  ' autosave-1, then the road
wait 30
wait 30
wait 30
mapclick 110,122         ' back: autosave-2
wait 30
wait 30
wait 30
load                     ' autosave-1, day 1
wait 5
press up
press right
press q                  ' no autosave this time
wait 30
wait 30
wait 30
mapclick 110,122         ' autosave-1 again, the older slot
wait 30
wait 30
wait 30
press o
wait 5
snap autosaves
quit
